{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t亞殘運游泳項目，港隊在混合S14級4X100米自由泳接力賽，奪得銅牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n決賽有4支隊伍角逐，港隊由陳睿琳、劉肖儀、張浚諾和黃漢彥出賽，初段一度守於泰國隊之後的第二位置，東道主日本隊在尾段趕過港隊及泰國隊奪得冠軍，港隊游出3分53秒77的時間，為港隊增添銅牌。韓國隊以第4名完成賽事。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:02:16.724831+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T11:45:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T12:37:47.576568+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T11:57:47.147809+00:00","content_hash":"fff9f9cabbe9ee08bbcb3bb695ead7b557e38c9f1217ee288c781d5ab4c1286a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}